# retention 90d) — the manifest pins their checksums
artifacts/evidence/rotations/

# ── the private ntfy push topic (Oct 7, Phase 0 rotation hygiene) ──
# All three were TRACKED until today, and the monero bundle builder
# ships `git archive kraken_scout HEAD` — so the public zip served at
# pool /downloads/KrakenScoutBundle.zip carried the topic in 3 entries
# (anyone with the URL could subscribe and read every BUY / GET OUT).
# Untracked + denied means the archive door (the commit itself) can
# never carry them again. The live files STAY on disk: the scanner
# re-reads push_topic.txt on every send, no restart needed.
push_topic.txt
_ntfydiag.txt
.workshop/
